{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamlab is a game engine and a platform for playing games. It's the fastest way to create multiplayer games and share them with the world! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover New Multiplayer Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for something new to play with your friends? Find your next game and start playing instantly for free! Dreamlab features games in a variety of genres:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack-n-slash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker / Incremental</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle / Escape room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New games are created with Dreamlab every day, so you'll always have something new to try!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful and Collaborative Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create games quickly with our easy-to-use editor. Get started instantly and collaborate with others in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978040/extras/ba4abdea67622d565fe4b4c26ee3a7c2.avif?t=1773082177\" width=1399 height=859 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Dreamlab community today; it's a welcoming place for people who love to play and create games together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978040?t=1773082177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978040?t=1773082177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978040/37249e1a9c331e0bebb1f393f33a78e331828bf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773082177","capsule_imagev5":"https://sha